### 1. 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test4@wit.com",
  "password": "password123$",
  "nickname": "위트작가4"
}

> {% client.global.set("auth_email", response.body.email); %}

### 2. 로그인 (토큰 발급)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test2@wit.com",
  "password": "password123@"
}

> {% client.global.set("access_token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 3. 내 정보 조회 (토큰 사용)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members/me
Authorization: Bearer {{발급받은토큰}}
Accept: application/json